text:
ana_partnerships: starting a quick thread to finalize SI co-sell handshake rules for the marketplace + HW launch. main risks: stalled marketplace leads, unclear crediting, and demo kit logistics. thoughts?

sam_sales: we need a single source of truth for "SI-introduced" vs "marketplace". propose: SI-introduced = explicit partner intro email or fastpass token. marketplace = no token.

mike_se: agree. Suggest fastpass token validity = 72h. hot leads (request demo/poC) = 48h claim window, warm = 72h. also add a partner_score (0-100) to help routing.

rachel_ps: marketing ask: small "SI-enabled" badge and short blurb for the listing describing next steps if an SI claims the lead. will need legal signoff for logos.

jordan_ops: ops items: add fields to lead schema: partner_origin, si_name, marketplace_listing_id, fastpass_token, partner_score, co_sell_credit_pct. add an "SI claimed" status and auto-alert to #partner-triage on expiry.

lee_hwpartner: from HW side: some accounts require physical demo kits. can we flag leads with hw_tag=true and auto-create a fulfillment task? lead owners need ETA on shipping.

mike_se: yes — if hw_tag && account_tier >= midmarket then fulfillment_flag=true and ops emits shipping task. proposal: mark those as "hw-cert-account" in mapping.

listing-bot: Reminder: marketplace copy freeze 2024-09-10 UTC. any listing copy referencing SI participation must be approved by 2024-09-03.

ana_partnerships: governance notes: co-billing requires LOA for deals > $50k. Legal to review press text. For crediting default co_sell_credit_pct = 20% unless overridden in partner_profile.

sam_sales: Can someone drop concise routing pseudo-logic so AMs can follow?

mike_se: dropping compact routing logic below (for AMs):

```
if (fastpass_token && token_age <= 72h) {
  route = "si-immediate"; claim_window = 72h;
} else if (partner_score >= 75 && account_tier == "enterprise") {
  route = "si-priority"; claim_window = 48h;
} else if (hw_tag == true && account_tier != "small") {
  route = "hw-si-first"; claim_window = 48h;
} else if (lead_origin == "marketplace_trial") {
  route = "hosted-first"; claim_window = 72h;
} else {
  route = "si-shared"; claim_window = 72h;
}
```

mike_se: SFDC fields to set: partner_origin, si_name, partner_score, fastpass_token, marketplace_listing_id, co_sell_credit_pct, claimed_at, claimed_by. use a tag partner_escalation_q3 for escalation.

rachel_ps: enablement will produce: 1) 1-pager co-sell play, 2) two outreach templates (partner-introduced vs marketplace), 3) short recording + demo kit checklist. will post by Fri.

jordan_ops: webhook prototype will POST to registered SI endpoints on claim. example payload (stringified for this thread):

```
{
  "lead_id": "L-50291",
  "account_name": "NorthStar LLC",
  "route": "si-priority",
  "claim_window_hours": 48,
  "partner_origin": "CloudPartnerZ",
  "si_name": "CloudPartnerZ SI",
  "fastpass_token": "fp-2024-09-xyz",
  "co_sell_credit_pct": "20%"
}
```

jordan_ops: we'll also send a human-friendly email notification to the SI POC when claim is created. ops will add the #partner-triage alert rule for claims > window.

lee_hwpartner: request: can marketplace listing show "hardware-compatible" badge and a note that on-prem demos may incur shipping lead times? helps set expectations.

rachel_ps: yes we can add that copy. legal: please review by 2024-09-03 for logos and claims.

ana_partnerships: next actions:
- sam_sales: list partner overrides + credit percentages by Tue COB.
- mike_se: finalize routing decision table + sample SFDC mapping by Wed.
- rachel_ps: deliver enablement assets + badge copy by Fri.
- jordan_ops: add lead schema fields + webhook prototype to staging by Mon.
- lee_hwpartner: confirm demo kit logistics and shipping SLA.

sam_sales: quick governance Q — should we create a new SFDC record type for SI-introduced leads or use tagging?

mike_se: prefer tagging to avoid new record type complexity; revisit if reporting gaps appear.

jordan_ops: tagging is fine for Q3. we'll surface analytics issues if any.

ana_partnerships: thanks all. scheduling a 30-min sync Mon 10am PT to walk the ops playbook and incidents. please drop exceptions here or DM me. :thumbsup:
